    "detailed_description": "Hey everyone! I'm Hudson, and I like to make games. This is a fast action FPS that you don't wanna miss! Here is a list of some things to get you prepared to play:<br />\r\n1. You can only see one of your guns, but there is always another gun there, sometimes there's two!<br />\r\n2. There are 18 levels, 3 levels per weapon type, 6 weapon types.<br />\r\n3. There is an Open World where you can run around and pickup weapons and heals!<br />\r\nIf you want to learn more there is a Documentation you can read in the game itself. If you have any suggestions, feel free to comment below. I will try to answer all of them! Enjoy!",
